<text><loc_256><loc_359><loc_442><loc_414>Checkpoint conversion Figure 4 compares the performance of different methods for checkpoint conversion. Mean pooling appears to work best, followed by selecting a single head and then random initialization. Intuitively, results are ordered by the degree to which information is preserved from the pre-trained model.</text>
